{"about_the_game":"<strong>What will you do?</strong><br>In Dungeon Slayer, you will lead your team to defeat countless enemies in a fantasy world. Your team will complete various missions.<br><br><strong>Key features</strong><br>- Unlock heroes with different abilities<br>- Explore a fantasy world<br>- A great focus on strategy<br>- Defeat your enemy using environmental features<br>- Easy to learn, hard to master<br><br><strong>Discover how the environment reacts to your heroes' abilities</strong><br>Use items such as the explosive and flammable barrel in your environment to beat your enemies.<br>In addition to that, you can use the harmful traps to your advantage by attacking nearby enemies from the right angle.<br><br>More and more interesting elements are being added to the game to encourage strategy and planning. Allowing you to explore more ways to slay your enemies and be victorious. As a fantasy hero, you will battle your way through the dark world and overcome the challenges by unlocking your team members with unique abilities.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cdea687a682c540e7b43adfdd87af257a7a0cf9b.jpg","localized_name":"First Triumph","name":"First Triumph","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1177580/cdea687a682c540e7b43adfdd87af257a7a0cf9b.jpg"},{"icon":"a7018e4a18eba19d9716142aeb5e825dc37a448e.jpg","localized_name":"Second Cycle","name":"Second Cycle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1177580/a7018e4a18eba19d9716142aeb5e825dc37a448e.jpg"},{"icon":"a2e4e8f1b6b73e3c169811426b7bad2443a88eef.jpg","localized_name":"Third Cycle","name":"Third Cycle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1177580/a2e4e8f1b6b73e3c169811426b7bad2443a88eef.jpg"},{"icon":"25f623e07903aeb12f4459e65f4c345253c5f06e.jpg","localized_name":"Iron March","name":"Iron March","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1177580/25